{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stout Kayak is an actively developing game with regular updates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrills of extreme whitewater kayaking like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stout Kayak is a physics-based whitewater kayaking simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on <strong>sensation, flow, and mastery</strong> rather than arcade-style or assisted gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a passionate independent developer, Stout Kayak offers a <strong>gradual learning curve that rewards practice</strong>. It\u2019s designed for players who enjoy <strong>immersive sensations and the realism of extreme kayaking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully immersive <strong>open-world adventure</strong> where every rapid, waterfall, and wave is crafted for spectacular freestyle tricks. Paddle through untamed rivers, leap from daring cliffs, and explore secret caves to find hidden diamonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Realistic kayak physics and dynamic water simulation<br>\u2022 Perform breathtaking tricks: boof, flip, roll, and more<br>\u2022 Open-world exploration with dynamic weather and day/night cycle<br>\u2022 Drive your truck to Upper Lake or the dam and choose between multiple rivers<br>\u2022 Warm up by the campfire and tackle the Stout slalom challenge<br>\u2022 Multiple cinematic cameras for total immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Customize your style!</strong> Change the look of your kayak, jacket, helmet, and paddle with a variety of models and colors. Create your unique style and make the rivers your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a laid-back explorer or an adrenaline junkie, Stout Kayak offers the perfect mix of <strong>relaxing vibes and intense action</strong>. Grab your paddle, turn the music up, and get ready to face the wild nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Stout Kayak community</strong> on Reddit or Facebook:<br>r/StoutKayak<br>FB: Stout Kayak Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players, ask questions, share feedback and ideas on the Steam HUB, and help us <strong>build the game together!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910190?t=1766430038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/0e04d505f2447b75319fd1c643cf3b51c17db948/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766430038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766430038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766430038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stout Kayak is an actively developing game with regular updates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrills of extreme whitewater kayaking like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stout Kayak is a physics-based whitewater kayaking simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on <strong>sensation, flow, and mastery</strong> rather than arcade-style or assisted gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a passionate independent developer, Stout Kayak offers a <strong>gradual learning curve that rewards practice</strong>. It\u2019s designed for players who enjoy <strong>immersive sensations and the realism of extreme kayaking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully immersive <strong>open-world adventure</strong> where every rapid, waterfall, and wave is crafted 